{"title":"Downwind of Mossreach","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Ossa Penhallow has watched Mossreach Swamp creep forty paces past her old cutting beds in three years, and she thinks the harpies on Gregor&#39;s road and the moving bog are the same story.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/ossa-penhallow\">Ossa Penhallow</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"ossa-penhallow\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p class=\"g-note\">Not known yet: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/ossa-penhallow\">Ossa Penhallow</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Trollbarrow)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"1186|-350|Ossa Penhallow\">Show on map</button></li></ol><p class=\"g-note\">The rest of the steps are still missing: the data for this quest is incomplete.</p></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>600</td></tr><t